      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_month_token_must_be_at_most_12",
      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "Root cause. The RFC 3339 month parser accepts token `13` because its upper bound is `13` instead of `12`. That invalid month survives into `struct tm`, and the next line converts it to zero-based index `12`, which later drives the out-of-bounds `month_yday` lookup."
    },
    {
